                              moment-series(6) = +9.73216595e-01  MATCH
     FAST (cos(10 u/T_mem)):  response amplitude (two-phase) = 0.099504
                              predicted |M~(w)| = 1/sqrt(1+w^2) = 0.099504   ratio 1.00000
                              moment-series(6) = -9.814e+05   DIVERGES (~w^6)
     => SLOW: the moment (local/adiabatic) expansion IS the response;
